<body>
    <h1>V3: UCAS Platform Engineering Readiness Checklist</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h2 local-id=3D"6b216a0c7fea" id=3D"V3:UCASPlatformEngineeringReadi=
nessChecklist-1.DataConnections">1. Data Connections</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"f62598240b91" id=3D"V3:UCASPlatformEngineeringReadinessChec=
klist-DataIngestion">Data Ingestion</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"a329a677-7394-4689-b930-08533f3beae5">
<li local-id=3D"01e45b6a-4282-4d4e-994c-b67d5eaee94e">
<p local-id=3D"4340854ef77c">How is data received by UCAS?</p>
<ul local-id=3D"54c222dd891b">
<li local-id=3D"8388906b0820">
<p local-id=3D"3cd404366a44">Findings</p>
<ul local-id=3D"fe4d538ec5e4">
<li local-id=3D"18f9f35f15ea">
<p local-id=3D"e3729df50f31">Athena</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"0dfb30fc4162">
<p local-id=3D"e820516075e9">Akamai</p>
<ul local-id=3D"9a86d0d9d1d3">
<li local-id=3D"6cfbc92553af">
<p local-id=3D"7136e3334553">Athena</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"7e0f3913ad0b">
<p local-id=3D"220a8ab5d8b6">Pipeline</p>
<ul local-id=3D"7c969b098807">
<li local-id=3D"ae6a540cf58d">
<p local-id=3D"58ea723c9dbc">API (GitHub Harness)</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"75f6c72c71d2">
<p local-id=3D"5867a34a316a">Onboarded</p>
<ul local-id=3D"d963a0dd1013">
<li local-id=3D"8dd502c1a798">
<p local-id=3D"fb55aff58813">Athena</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"399bc7a71c04">
<p local-id=3D"4851eea90408">CodeQL</p>
<ul local-id=3D"08fb1f59e9b8">
<li local-id=3D"2bdfbab8f9a3">
<p local-id=3D"061f2e337ef6">API (GitHub)</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"3bf27d27-42f1-4bac-be6c-5933ff9c0067">
<p local-id=3D"257845d158ff">What data sources are integrated (tools, APIs,=
 event streams, etc.)?</p>
<ul local-id=3D"ae5481689faa">
<li local-id=3D"5a531363274b">
<p local-id=3D"8859f6ec7b05">Answered Above</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"d3885ddd-6d17-44d6-bfb6-6f010154410d">
<p local-id=3D"afb0b6287b04">Does UCAS support both local and cloud access?=
</p>
<ul local-id=3D"aafb0debb84b">
<li local-id=3D"44a6dc10da31">
<p local-id=3D"5a9de6cda0ce">Tested in. local and Dev environments to ensur=
e data is flowing to UCAS from each source as expected</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"88a1894d1036" id=3D"V3:UCASPlatformEngineeringReadinessChec=
klist-EnvironmentValidation">Environment Validation</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"d144a994-1055-4b38-848b-28c204fc2419">
<li local-id=3D"2d9422ac-8087-4aa3-a247-f3529044072e">
<p local-id=3D"4ff75364f29e">Has data connectivity been validated in:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"c8190dfe-3ba1-470d-beb8-67ef870d5601">
<li local-id=3D"890b17c4-a61f-4226-8fb8-13612818f1f6">
<p local-id=3D"c09b86846ff9">Local environment</p>
<ul local-id=3D"d8981673674a">
<li local-id=3D"0014f6815ce3">
<p local-id=3D"166a97dc7a2f">Tested Apr 21 2026: All Data flowing to UCAS</=
p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"392accc2-5c34-4b9e-9caa-da391ef6947b">
<p local-id=3D"b6d7cc6d2f66">Development environment</p>
<ul local-id=3D"a68809fc54e1">
<li local-id=3D"a47d29a8b12f">
<p local-id=3D"32b56f6a354c">Tested Apr 21 2026: All Data flowing to UCAS</=
p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"5e8222dd9499" id=3D"V3:UCASPlatformEngineeringReadinessChec=
klist-Observability&amp;Reliability">Observability &amp; Reliability</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"c901ef41-315d-4d16-a898-51409f082564">
<li local-id=3D"721ed6ca-94fe-4995-9748-94a5edbafdd8">
<p local-id=3D"d27e8dc117c3">Are failures in data ingestion logged and obse=
rvable?</p>
<ul local-id=3D"a90456dcac1a">
<li local-id=3D"bc3eaddb20af">
<p local-id=3D"7049401a7de6">Data failures can be found in the logs of each=
 lambda and can also be queried in the Athena recent query engine</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"5b6f50fffd65" id=3D"V3:UCASPlatformEngineeringReadinessChec=
klist-Handoff">Handoff</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"7a503199-c080-439c-9582-e12d75a1b108">
<li local-id=3D"60595ee6-d447-4e9f-a23d-4980da697526">
<p local-id=3D"ab1da405713f">Data handoff completed</p>
<ul local-id=3D"014db7a64672">
<li local-id=3D"2cde920abc1c">
<p local-id=3D"f0d7444edfc4">Data is handed off to UCAS for processing for =
all validators</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"04d9d338-fa0b-4046-99a5-2d85ebf787ec">
<h2 local-id=3D"35e38dd41130" id=3D"V3:UCASPlatformEngineeringReadinessChec=
klist-2.InfrastructureasCode(IaC)">2. Infrastructure as Code (IaC)</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"6651042d723f" id=3D"V3:UCASPlatformEngineeringReadinessChec=
klist-Permissions&amp;Deployment">Permissions &amp; Deployment</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"ca411640-ef71-46e6-b439-9f6623135d8f">
<li local-id=3D"5cf57c16-e0e0-4421-a812-099dd97e26e8">
<p local-id=3D"6c75c2b352ad">Does the IaC have the required permissions to =
access all necessary resources?</p>
<ul local-id=3D"8b09aee35b31">
<li local-id=3D"6c95f95a349c">
<p local-id=3D"d69f3c7243a7">Each validator has been tested for permissions=
 to ensure</p>
<ul local-id=3D"f2ddff381b8a">
<li local-id=3D"7b8114e5c34a">
<p local-id=3D"4c326a7a10e1">Data can be queried</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"66212a84c539">
<p local-id=3D"dbf3a08e8e9f">Dispatch can talk to each SQS</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"863d638c7a99">
<p local-id=3D"3745c12a70de">validators can write to the new validation tab=
le</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d9304a24da50">
<p local-id=3D"41212e5899b6">resolver can write to processing table</p></li=
>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"be5c0238-e9c2-48cd-97f0-640f2e98ab10">
<p local-id=3D"1a61a3c55e71">Can the infrastructure deploy and run without =
errors?</p>
<ul local-id=3D"818ef3a0a0ce">
<li local-id=3D"2eed5e33011e">
<p local-id=3D"9c7488d97d28">Yes IF</p>
<ul local-id=3D"804334e796b0">
<li local-id=3D"9dd4355abab0">
<p local-id=3D"8bc1a5afae3b">Deploy <code>eqa-cross-account-role-stack eqa-=
udcrm-datalake-buckets</code> first</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"e3bf5d3cf432" id=3D"V3:UCASPlatformEngineeringReadinessChec=
klist-Logging&amp;Observability">Logging &amp; Observability</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"26a5366c-369d-41e2-bccc-aa64d0a732d7">
<li local-id=3D"80679828-eba0-4d47-b07d-581957208eb6">
<p local-id=3D"4f13935a1300">Are logs available that clearly describe what =
each Lambda/function is doing?</p>
<ul local-id=3D"1180ebf7a7c1">
<li local-id=3D"7d6653a5729d">
<p local-id=3D"865316660ec4">All lambdas are logged for each step</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"3428400b-fa32-4941-b156-2f2fdc37bfa2">
<p local-id=3D"4e6decdff091">Are logs searchable? (TBD)</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"420871118aaf" id=3D"V3:UCASPlatformEngineeringReadinessChec=
klist-Testing&amp;Validation">Testing &amp; Validation</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"c2c02973-4680-414b-9932-b06126790c11">
<li local-id=3D"e1deb246-1ddf-43d6-9eab-554cee7a30fd">
<p local-id=3D"282271293e5b">Has the IaC been fully tested after deployment=
 to the dev environment?</p>
<ul local-id=3D"aece4c23a1c1">
<li local-id=3D"502288081466">
<p local-id=3D"ea781e92f8ec">Complete Apr 21 2026</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"36a154757424" id=3D"V3:UCASPlatformEngineeringReadinessChec=
klist-Handoff.1">Handoff</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"e30509d9-425a-42ec-9d05-3a782194dc5e">
<li local-id=3D"6eacd82e-cc2a-4dae-8466-74282f00c324">
<p local-id=3D"a62dc4743b3e">IaC handoff completed</p>
<ul local-id=3D"7539e21fd337">
<li local-id=3D"add01d0f8690">
<p local-id=3D"bbce5cdbdabe">Complete Apr 21 2026</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"f4a0107a-652c-4ef8-addb-11333344d5b6">
<h2 local-id=3D"60e85b274ba2" id=3D"V3:UCASPlatformEngineeringReadinessChec=
klist-3.ControlAutomationReasonableness">3. Control Automation Reasonablene=
ss</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"6549de5eadc9" id=3D"V3:UCASPlatformEngineeringReadinessChec=
klist-ControlCoverage&amp;Results">Control Coverage &amp; Results</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"1da0ee57-d3f1-4fc9-9fc9-613a010e0970">
<li local-id=3D"33b1f693-2441-4e3e-bb5c-3b6c6c2e312f">
